  m_Name: Pilote -Mail Promotion
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  title: Promotion!
  character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8db74389b8c31914dbe8c9c4cf3c818b, type: 2}
  mailText: 'Hello Employee,

    I am pleased to inform you that you can now give
    promotions to employees. You don''t have to, but if you feel that any of your
    employees deserve it, now is the time to reward them!

    However, only those
    who took a break of less than 30 minutes and have at least three A''s and no
    E''s at their H.E.A.L.T.H. score are eligible.


    P.S. Try not to give too
    many promotions. '
